  "instructions": [
    "Mix collard greens, garlic, ginger, green onions, and salt in a bowl.",
    "Add Kimchi paste and mix well.",
    "Add sesame oil, soy sauce, sugar, and rice vinegar. Mix until combined.",
    "Add rice flour and water to the mixture. Mix until a dough forms.",
    "Knead the dough on a floured surface for 10 minutes.",
    "Divide the dough into 8 equal portions.",
    "Roll each portion into a ball and flatten slightly into a disk shape.",
    "Heat a non-stick pan over medium heat.",
    "Add 2 disks of dough to the pan and cook for 2 minutes on each side.",
    "Serve hot with your favorite dipping sauce."
